          "sourceId": "web-act-27-44",
          "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/ACT27.htm#V44",
          "text": "and the rest should follow, some on planks and some on other things from the ship. So they all escaped safely to the land.",
          "textStatus": "present"
        },
        {
          "ref": "Acts 28:1",
          "sourceId": "web-act-28-1",
          "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/ACT28.htm#V1",
